;. /conversation_response_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition respond
  ;= Author a projected Nenex response

    The response is a Nenex document projected into the conversation. These
    ordinary flow steps select the response policy, interactive provider and
    validated document result. Edit and publish this procedure like any other
    Semidoc flow. A conversation selects an exact published definition.

    ;@ /flow/input context
    ;= Selected message, previous turns and wiki evidence

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= Explicit interactive provider capability

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/conversation/response_task
    ;@ /flow/bind context context
    ;= Prepare the authored response request

    ;@ /flow/step response ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= Delegate through the shared native request hand

    ;@ /flow/step pages ;/0x11/gov/conversation/response_pages
    ;@ /flow/bind responses response
    ;= Preserve the validated Semidoc and its relationships

    ;@ /flow/result pages
    ;= Publish through the selected Nenex writer
